### Login de usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login
content-type: application/json

{
    "email": "superman@gmail.com",
    "password": "12345678"
}

### Registro de usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 167|IKs2MAZAsneFvhqUy3drLqJqW6VBSqM1NgeeIUja3a766d4d

{
    "rol_id": 3,
    "email": "prueba456@gmail.com",
    "password": "12345678",
    "password_confirmation": "12345678",
    "name": "Usuario 456",
    "unidad_operativa": "El Marquez"
}

### Cambio Contraseña de usuario activo
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/change-password
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 150|w4MBeHNWVto1pe6rGNGxL4jYs45OlRMvL8ypBszJbb5b1744

{
    "current_password": "87654321",
    "new_password": "12345678",
    "new_password_confirmation": "12345678"
}

### Cambio Datos Básicos de usuario (rol, name, unidad_operativa)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/change-data-basic
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 176|4Opl9QjI81aEqVpos98wvw1fg0izvxaMb8mGGAnMdd0139cb

{
    "user_id": 3,
    "name": "Usuario 3 modificado",
    "rol_id": 3,
    "unidad-operativa": "Camatagua, edo Aragua"
}

### Inhabilitar Usuario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/disable-user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json  <--- AGREGA ESTA LÍNEA
Authorization: Bearer 176|4Opl9QjI81aEqVpos98wvw1fg0izvxaMb8mGGAnMdd0139cb

{
    "user_id": 26
}

### Listar todos los usuarios registrados
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/showUsers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 176|4Opl9QjI81aEqVpos98wvw1fg0izvxaMb8mGGAnMdd0139cb

